## Typography

Use Apple system fonts.

SF Pro Display style for:

- logo
- section titles
- top bar labels

SF Pro Text style for:

- song titles
- artist names
- metadata
- buttons
- controls

Suggested scale:

- App title: 24pt bold
- Section title: 15pt semibold
- Song title: 13pt semibold
- Body: 12pt regular
- Metadata: 10pt medium

## Layout

Landscape for iPhone only. Rotate display shows when vertical.

Main screen must include:

- left song sidebar
- top playback controls
- large waveform timeline
- right-side solo/mute buttons
- bottom tools drawer
- AI Suggestions button
- export button

Everything important should remain visible.

No tab bar.
No navigation stack.
No modal-heavy interface.

## Material System

Glass panels should use:

- translucent dark surfaces
- subtle blur
- thin light border
- soft inner depth
- restrained shadows

Do not use solid flat panels unless needed.

## Cursor Behavior

Before writing code:

1. Explain implementation plan.
2. List files to create or edit.
3. Wait for approval.

When coding:

- Modify only relevant files.
- Keep files small.
- Use reusable SwiftUI components.
- Do not rewrite unrelated code.
- Do not add dependencies unless asked.
- Do not implement real app functionality yet.